        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>&quot;a night of overtime you’ve grown accustomed to&quot;</strong> in this ultra-short horror game.<br>But unlike the usual grind, the entire office tonight feels…off, ominous and Strange. <br>Your coworkers are nowhere to be found. The lights are dim. And something — or <i>someone</i> — unknown is lurking.<br>Can you make it until the end of your shift?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overtime Syndrome – A Night Shift Story</strong> is a free, ultra-short horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you take on the role of <strong>Max</strong>, an overworked corporate drone stuck on yet another late-night shift — only this time, something’s not quite right. Strange and unsettling events begin to unfold. As Max, you’ll try to finish your work and make it through the night… hopefully alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>First-Person Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras/7f293c901428ac62f32cd0875d472cf0.avif?t=1762768651\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras_big/7f293c901428ac62f32cd0875d472cf0.webp?t=1762768651 width=1560 height=914 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the night shift from Max’s own eyes.<br>Control Max as you complete tasks, collect items, and follow mysterious leads in the hope of leaving work early — or at least leaving alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Company’s Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras/2481ad675cfdb0a1f475a1e392a40892.avif?t=1762768651\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras_big/2481ad675cfdb0a1f475a1e392a40892.webp?t=1762768651 width=1560 height=917 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This decades-old company has a story of its own.<br>In this game, piece together the background of the company, uncover the hidden truth behind its decaying office, and discover the cause of the strange events you’re experiencing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Phone is Your Lifeline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras/6224619e54d18e558fb21ed31645d39f.avif?t=1762768651\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras_big/6224619e54d18e558fb21ed31645d39f.webp?t=1762768651 width=1560 height=785 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who carries a old flashlight everywhere?<br>It’s 2025 — everybody has a smartphone! And when it comes to lighting your way, your phone’s flashlight will be your best friend.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>&quot;a night of overtime you’ve grown accustomed to&quot;</strong> in this ultra-short horror game.<br>But unlike the usual grind, the entire office tonight feels…off, ominous and Strange. <br>Your coworkers are nowhere to be found. The lights are dim. And something — or <i>someone</i> — unknown is lurking.<br>Can you make it until the end of your shift?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overtime Syndrome – A Night Shift Story</strong> is a free, ultra-short horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you take on the role of <strong>Max</strong>, an overworked corporate drone stuck on yet another late-night shift — only this time, something’s not quite right. Strange and unsettling events begin to unfold. As Max, you’ll try to finish your work and make it through the night… hopefully alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>First-Person Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras/7f293c901428ac62f32cd0875d472cf0.avif?t=1762768651\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras_big/7f293c901428ac62f32cd0875d472cf0.webp?t=1762768651 width=1560 height=914 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the night shift from Max’s own eyes.<br>Control Max as you complete tasks, collect items, and follow mysterious leads in the hope of leaving work early — or at least leaving alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Company’s Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras/2481ad675cfdb0a1f475a1e392a40892.avif?t=1762768651\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras_big/2481ad675cfdb0a1f475a1e392a40892.webp?t=1762768651 width=1560 height=917 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This decades-old company has a story of its own.<br>In this game, piece together the background of the company, uncover the hidden truth behind its decaying office, and discover the cause of the strange events you’re experiencing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Phone is Your Lifeline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras/6224619e54d18e558fb21ed31645d39f.avif?t=1762768651\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918340/extras_big/6224619e54d18e558fb21ed31645d39f.webp?t=1762768651 width=1560 height=785 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who carries a old flashlight everywhere?<br>It’s 2025 — everybody has a smartphone! And when it comes to lighting your way, your phone’s flashlight will be your best friend.</p>",
        "short_description": "Experience “just another late night shift at the office” in this ultra-short horror game. Somehow this night, the whole office is filled with an eerie, unsettling atmosphere. Missing coworkers, dim lights, and a mysterious presence known only as “it”... Will you make it to the end of your shift?",
